  "description": "DI-friendly file transfer library for .NET built for safe, deterministic file and directory operations.\n\nIncludes preflight validation, verification, rollback-aware execution, structured error aggregation, and pluggable strategies (Safe and RoboCopy). Optional progress callbacks enable seamless UI and console integration.\n\nEngineered with SOLID principles and Dependency Injection for clean, testable, and maintainable systems.\n\nFree for personal use. Commercial use requires a one-time license.",
