  "readmeFile": "README_NUGET.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release Notes\n• Added optional transfer progress reporting with friendly user-facing step text.\n• Added step-level and overall percent complete values (0-100).\n• Added explicit step-complete and transfer-complete progress notifications.\n• Added end-to-end manual transfer tests for file copy, folder copy, file move, and folder move.\n• Expanded automated and integration coverage.\n• Fixed ProcessRunner completion behavior to avoid hangs under coverage/profiling scenarios.\n• Added InternalsVisibleTo support for deeper internal test coverage.\n• Standardized partial class organization and file naming for cleaner nesting and maintenance.\n• Clarified destination parent, overwrite, and existing-content behavior in the README.",
